      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The simplest I can put it:\n**Current system** measures how close a sender enters inside a proximity receivers radius.\n(that radius is fixed by the receiver)\n**I want** to measure how far the receiver has entered the currently colliding senders radius.\n(radius depends on the colliding sender, so it is not fixed by the receiver)\nThe receiver still handles the proximity parameter. I am not requesting changes to contact senders.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
